### Test Email Reports in Production
### Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = https://stockapi.sekuu.com/api

### Test Daily Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/trigger/daily
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Weekly Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/trigger/weekly
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Monthly Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/trigger/monthly
Content-Type: application/json

###
